r','Display widgets below the place order button at the checkout page.' => 'Tampilake widget ing ngisor tombol pesenan ing kaca checkout.','Checkout Footer' => 'Checkout Footer','Display widgets on the checkout footer. Only displayed if using the plugin\'s checkout footer.' => 'Tampilake widget ing footer checkout. Mung ditampilake yen nggunakake footer checkout plugin.','Classic' => 'Klasik','Boxed' => 'kothak','Split' => 'Pisah','Minimalist' => 'Minimalis','Fluid Checkout and Delivery Date plugins by CodeRockz' => 'Plugin Checkout Cairan lan Tanggal Pangiriman dening CodeRockz','<p>We detected that you are using the plugins Delivery & Pickup Date Time for WooCommerce (free and PRO) by CodeRockz. Integration with these plugins have been moved to Fluid Checkout PRO.</p>' => '<p>Kita ndeteksi manawa sampeyan nggunakake plugin Delivery &amp; Pickup Date Time kanggo WooCommerce (gratis lan PRO) dening CodeRockz. Integrasi karo plugin iki wis dipindhah menyang Fluid Checkout PRO.</p>','Upgrade to PRO' => 'Nganyarke menyang PRO','Fluid Checkout database updated successfully' => 'Database Fluid Checkout dianyari kanthi sukses','The database changes where applied successfully.' => 'Basis data owah-owahan ing ngendi ditrapake kanthi sukses.','Dismiss' => 'Mbucal','Fluid Checkout database update' => 'Nganyari database Fluid Checkout','Some changes to the database are required. As with any update, we recommend you to <strong>take a full backup of your website before proceeding</strong>.' => 'Sawetara owah-owahan ing database dibutuhake. Kaya nganyari apa wae, disaranake sampeyan <strong>njupuk serep lengkap situs web sadurunge nerusake</strong> .','Update database' => 'Nganyari database','Fluid Checkout is not compatible with the Divi Builder checkout layout' => 'Fluid Checkout ora kompatibel karo tata letak checkout Divi Builder','<p>Fluid Checkout needs the classic WooCommerce shortcode-based checkout form to work. When using the Divi Builder to customize the look and feel 