 optimizations' => 'Aktifake optimasi kaca cart','Header and footer template' => 'Cithakan header lan footer','Controls whether to use the distraction free page header and footer or keep the currently active theme\'s header and footer.' => 'Ngontrol manawa nggunakake header lan footer kaca tanpa gangguan utawa njaga header lan footer tema sing saiki aktif.','Distraction free header and footer' => 'Header lan footer bebas gangguan','Theme\'s header and footer' => 'Header lan footer tema','Cart elements' => 'unsur kréta','Make the order summary stay visible on the cart page while scrolling' => 'Nggawe ringkesan pesenan tetep katon ing kaca cart nalika nggulung','Coupon codes' => 'kode kupon','Hidden' => 'didhelikake','Before the cart items section' => 'Sadurunge bagean item cart','Inside the cart items section' => 'Nang bagean item cart','After the cart items section' => 'Sawise bagean barang cart','Before the shipping section' => 'Sadurunge bagean pangiriman','After the shipping section' => 'Sawise bagean pangiriman','Before the order summary' => 'Sadurunge ringkesan pesenan','Inside the order summary' => 'Ing ringkesan pesenan','Before the order totals' => 'Sadurunge pesenan total','After the order totals' => 'Sawise total pesenan','After the order summary' => 'Sawise ringkesan pesenan','Shipping' => 'Pengiriman','Select position where to display the shipping costs and calculator on the cart page.' => 'Pilih posisi kanggo nampilake biaya pengiriman lan kalkulator ing kaca cart.','Display as a cart section' => 'Tampilake minangka bagean cart','Cross-sells' => 'Cross-sadean','Select position where to display the cross-sells section on the cart page.' => 'Pilih posisi ing ngendi kanggo nampilake bagean cross-sells ing kaca cart.','Before the cart actions' => 'Sadurunge tumindak cart','After the cart actions' => 'Sawise tumindak cart','Layout of cross-sell items on the cart page.' => 'Tata letak barang adol silang ing kaca kréta.','Optimized horizontal cross-sells layout' => 'Optimized tata letak cross-sade horisontal','Theme\'s cross-sells layout' => 'Tata letak lintas-sade tema','Number of cross-sell items to display on the cart page' => 'Jumlah item cross-sell kanggo ditampilake ing kaca cart','Add widget areas to the cart page' => 'Tambah area widget menyang kaca cart','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the cart page.' => 'Wilayah widget iki digunakake kanggo nambah simbol kapercayan lan lencana kapercayan ing kaca cart.','Checkout' => 'Checkout','Checkout layout' => 'tata letak checkout','Design template' => 'Cithakan desain','Dark mode' => 'Mode peteng','Enable dark mode' => 'Aktifake mode peteng','Logo image' => 'Gambar logo','Choose an image to be displayed on the checkout page header. Only applies when using the distraction free header and footer.' => 'Pilih gambar sing bakal ditampilake ing header kaca checkout. Mung ditrapake nalika nggunakake header lan footer bebas gangguan.','Header background color' => 'Werna latar mburi header','Choose a background color for the checkout page header. Only applies when using the distraction free header and footer.' => 'Pilih werna latar mburi kanggo header kaca checkout. Mung ditrapake nalika nggunakake header lan footer bebas gangguan.','HTML color value. ie: #f3f3f3' => 'Nilai warna HTML. yaiku: #f3f3f3','Page background color' => 'Werna latar mburi kaca','Choose a background color for the checkout page. Color is applied to the <em>body</em> element.' => 'Pilih werna latar mburi kanggo kaca checkout. Werna ditrapake kanggo unsur <em>awak</em> .','Footer background color' => 'Werna latar mburi footer','Choose a background color for the checkout page footer. Only applies when using the distraction free header and footer.' => 'Pilih werna latar mburi kanggo footer kaca checkout. Mung ditrapake nalika nggunakake header lan footer bebas gangguan.','Progress bar' => 'Bar kemajuan','Display the checkout progress bar when using multi-step checkout layout' => 'Tampilake garis kemajuan checkout nalika nggunakake tata letak checkout multi-langkah','Make the checkout progress bar stay visible while scrolling' => 'Nggawe garis kemajuan checkout tetep katon nalika nggulung','Express checkout' => 'Checkout ekspres','Enable the express checkout section' => 'Aktifake bagean checkout ekspres','Displays the express checkout section at checkout when supported payment gateways have this feature enabled.' => 'Nampilake bagean checkout ekspres nalika checkout nalika gateway pembayaran sing didhukung nduweni fitur iki.','Display express checkout buttons in one line for larger screens' => 'Tampilake tombol checkout ekspres ing siji baris kanggo layar sing luwih gedhe','Ignore additional checkout required fields when paying with a compatible express checkout payment gateway' => 'Nglirwakake lapangan checkout tambahan sing dibutuhake nalika mbayar nganggo gateway pembayaran checkout ekspres sing kompatibel','Make the order summary stay visible while scrolling' => 'Nggawe ringkesan pesenan tetep katon nalika nggulung','Choose a background color for the order summary section.' => 'Pilih werna latar mburi kanggo bagean ringkesan pesenan.','Highlight the order totals row in the order summary table' => 'Sorot baris total pesenan ing tabel ringkesan pesenan','Most useful when the order summary section does not have a highlighted background color. Might also apply to the Cart, Order Received and View Order pages when using Fluid Checkout PRO.' => 'Paling migunani nalika bagean ringkesan pesenan ora duwe warna latar mburi sing disorot. Bisa uga ditrapake ing Kréta, Pesenan Ditampa lan Ndeleng kaca Pesenan nalika nggunakake Fluid Checkout PRO.','Action link on the order summary at checkout.' => 'Link tumindak ing ringkesan pesenan ing checkout.','Edit cart link' => 'Sunting pranala cart','Cart items count' => 'Item cart count','Link to shop page' => 'Link menyang kaca toko','Cart items' => 'Barang kréta','Hide cart items errors at the checkout page' => 'Singidaken kesalahan item cart ing kaca checkout','Do not display the cart items errors message at the top of the checkout page. When submitting the checkout form to complete the purchase, these error messages will always be displayed.' => 'Aja nampilake pesen kesalahan item cart ing sisih ndhuwur kaca checkout. Nalika ngirim formulir checkout kanggo ngrampungake tuku, pesen kesalahan iki bakal tansah ditampilake.','Place order' => 'Panggonan pesenan','Define the position to display "Place order" and terms checkbox section.' => 'Netepake posisi kanggo nampilake &quot;Pesenan&quot; lan bagean kothak centhang.','Some options might not be compatible with some plugins and themes.' => 'Sawetara opsi bisa uga ora kompatibel karo sawetara plugin lan tema.','Below the payment section' => 'Ing ngisor bagean pembayaran','Below the order summary' => 'Ing ngisor iki ringkesan pesenan','Both below the payment section and the order summary' => 'Loro-lorone ing ngisor bagean pembayaran lan ringkesan pesenan','Add widget areas to the checkout page' => 'Tambah area widget menyang kaca checkout','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the checkout page.' => 'Wilayah widget iki digunakake kanggo nambah simbol kepercayaan lan lencana kepercayaan ing kaca checkout.','Display the coupon codes section title' => 'Tampilake judhul bagean kode kupon','Select position where to display the coupon codes section on the checkout page.' => 'Pilih posisi kanggo nampilake bagean kode kupon ing kaca checkout.','Before the checkout steps' => 'Sadurunge langkah checkout','As a substep before payment methods' => 'Minangka substep sadurunge cara pembayaran','As a substep after payment methods' => 'Minangka substep sawise cara pembayaran','Default button style' => 'Gaya tombol standar','"Add" link button' => '&quot;Tambah&quot; tombol link','Checkout fields' => 'kothak Checkout','Optional fields' => 'Kothak opsional','Hide optional fields behind a link button' => 'Singidaken kolom opsional ing mburi tombol link','It is recommended to keep this option checked to reduce the number of open input fields, <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#1-address-line-2--company-name-can-safely-be-collapsed-behind-a-link" target="_blank">read the research</a>.' => 'Disaranake supaya opsi iki dicenthang kanggo ngurangi jumlah kolom input mbukak, <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#1-address-line-2--company-name-can-safely-be-collapsed-behind-a-link" target="_blank">maca riset</a> .','Do not hide "Address line 2" fields behind a link button' => 'Aja ndhelikake kolom &quot;Alamat baris 2&quot; ing mburi tombol link','Recommended only when most customers actually need the "Address line 2" field, or when getting the right shipping address is crucial (ie. if delivering food and other perishable products).' => 'Dianjurake mung nalika paling pelanggan bener mbutuhake lapangan &quot;Alamat baris 2&quot;, utawa nalika njupuk alamat kapal tengen iku wigati (ie. yen ngirim pangan lan produk rusak liyane).','Billing address' => 'Alamat tagihan','Select position where to display the billing address section on the checkout page.' => 'Pilih posisi kanggo nampilake bagean alamat tagihan ing kaca checkout.','As a step before shipping' => 'Minangka langkah sadurunge ngirim','As a sub-step before the shipping address section' => 'Minangka sub-langkah sadurunge bagean alamat pengiriman','As a sub-step after the shipping address section' => 'Minangka sub-langkah sawise bagean alamat pengiriman','As a step after shipping' => 'Minangka langkah sawise pangiriman','As a sub-step before the payment section' => 'Minangka sub-langkah sadurunge bagean pembayaran','Force billing and shipping addresses to the same (single section)' => 'Meksa tagihan lan alamat pengiriman menyang padha (bagean siji)','Checkbox for "Same as shipping/billing address" checked by default' => 'Centhang kothak &quot;Sama karo alamat pengiriman/tagihan&quot; kanthi gawan','The checkbox "Same as shiping address" will start as checked by default when the shipping address section is displayed first. <br>The checkbox "Same as billing address" will start as checked by default when the billing address section is displayed first. <br> It is recommended to leave this option checked as to significantly reduce the number of open input fields at checkout, <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#3-default-billing--shipping-and-hide-the-fields-entirely" target="_blank">read the research</a>.' => 'Kothak centhang &quot;Same as shiping address&quot; bakal diwiwiti kaya sing dicenthang kanthi gawan nalika bagean alamat pengiriman ditampilake dhisik.<br> Kothak centhang &quot;Sama karo alamat tagihan&quot; bakal diwiwiti kaya sing dicenthang kanthi gawan nalika bagean alamat tagihan ditampilake dhisik.<br> Disaranake kanggo ninggalake opsi iki dicenthang minangka Ngartekno nyuda jumlah kolom input mbukak ing checkout, <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#3-default-billing--shipping-and-hide-the-fields-entirely" target="_blank">maca riset</a> .','Highlight the billing address section in the checkout form' => 'Nyorot bagean alamat tagihan ing formulir checkout','Shipping address' => 'alamat pengiriman','Highlight the shipping address section in the checkout form' => 'Nyorot bagean alamat pengiriman ing formulir checkout','Shipping methods' => 'cara pengiriman','Choose in which position to display the shipping methods section.' => 'Pilih ing posisi kanggo nampilake bagean cara pengiriman.','Before shipping address' => 'Sadurunge alamat pengiriman','After shipping address' => 'Sawise alamat pengiriman','Local pickup' => 'Pickup lokal','Removes shipping address section when a local pickup shipping method is selected.' => 'Mbusak bagean alamat pengiriman nalika cara pengiriman pickup lokal dipilih.','Replaces the shipping address with the pickup point location when a local pickup shipping method is selected.' => 'Ngganti alamat pengiriman karo lokasi titik pickup nalika cara pengiriman pickup lokal dipilih.','Choose which address to save as the shipping address for local pickup orders.' => 'Pilih alamat sing bakal disimpen minangka alamat pengiriman kanggo pesenan pickup lokal.','Save the selected pickup location' => 'Simpen lokasi pickup sing dipilih','Save same as the billing address' => 'Simpen padha karo alamat tagihan','Do not save any shipping address' => 'Aja nyimpen alamat pengiriman','Company name field for shipping address' => 'Kolom jeneng perusahaan kanggo alamat pengiriman','Change visibility for the company name field for the shipping address section on the checkout form.' => 'Ganti visibilitas kanggo kolom jeneng perusahaan kanggo bagean alamat pengiriman ing formulir checkout.','If field is set as "optional", which is the default visibility state, no changes will be applied to let other plugins apply any changes they need.' => 'Yen lapangan disetel minangka &quot;opsional&quot;, yaiku status visibilitas standar, ora ana owah-owahan sing bakal ditrapake supaya plugin liyane bisa ngetrapake owah-owahan sing dibutuhake.','Hidden (remove field)' => 'Didhelikake (mbusak kolom)','Optional' => 'Opsional','Required' => 'dibutuhake','Add shipping phone field to the checkout form.' => 'Tambah kolom telpon pengiriman menyang formulir checkout.','Choose in which step to display the shipping phone field.' => 'Pilih ing endi langkah kanggo nampilake kolom telpon pengiriman.','Contact step' => 'Langkah kontak','Billing phone' => 'Telpon tagihan','Add billing phone field to the checkout form.' => 'Tambah kolom telpon tagihan menyang formulir checkout.','Choose in which step to display the billing phone field.' => 'Pilih ing langkah kanggo nampilake kolom telpon tagihan.','Show country code beside the flag' => 'Tampilake kode negara ing jejere gendéra','Show an example of a valid phone number inside phone fields' => 'Tampilake conto nomer telpon sing bener ing kolom telpon','Do not change placeholders' => 'Aja ngganti placeholder','Show if not defined' => 'Tampilake yen ora ditetepake','Always show' => 'Tansah nuduhake','Order notes' => 'cathetan pesenan','Define the visibility of the additional order notes field.' => 'Netepake visibilitas lapangan cathetan pesenan tambahan.','Gift options' => 'Pilihan hadiah','Allow customers to add a gift message and other gift related options to the order.' => 'Ngidini pelanggan nambah pesen hadiah lan opsi liyane sing gegandhengan karo hadiah menyang pesenan.','Display the gift message as part of the order details table instead of a separate section' => 'Tampilake pesen hadiah minangka bagean saka tabel rincian pesenan tinimbang bagean sing kapisah','This option affects the order confirmation page (thank you page) and order details on account pages, emails and packing slips.' => 'Opsi iki mengaruhi kaca konfirmasi pesenan (kaca matur nuwun) lan rincian pesenan ing kaca akun, email lan slip pengepakan.','Account matching' => 'Akun cocog','Enable the account matching feature' => 'Aktifake fitur cocog akun','Associate the guest customer\'s orders with their existing account when an account already exists with the customer\'s contact details.' => 'Sambungake pesenan pelanggan tamu karo akun sing wis ana nalika akun wis ana karo rincian kontak pelanggan.','Display message when an account exists with the email address provided' => 'Tampilake pesen nalika ana akun kanthi alamat email sing diwenehake','Replaces the account creation fields with a notification and option to log in. In some contexts, it might be recommended to leave this option disabled to protect the privacy of customers.' => 'Ngganti kolom nggawe akun kanthi kabar lan pilihan kanggo mlebu. Ing sawetara konteks, disaranake supaya opsi iki dipateni kanggo nglindhungi privasi pelanggan.','Dashboard' => 'Dashboard','Integrations' => 'Integrasi','License keys' => 'Tombol lisensi','Visit our website for more information about our plugins and add-ons.' => 'Dolan maring situs web kita kanggo informasi luwih lengkap babagan plugin lan tambahan.','Order pay page' => 'Kaca mbayar pesenan','Order pay' => 'Pembayaran pesenan','Enable order pay page optimizations' => 'Aktifake optimasi kaca mbayar pesenan','Changes the layout of order pay page for existing orders pending payment from the customer.' => 'Ngganti tata letak kaca pembayaran pesenan kanggo pesenan sing wis ana sing nunggu pembayaran saka pelanggan.','Add widget areas to the order pay page' => 'Tambah wilayah widget menyang kaca mbayar pesenan','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the order pay page.' => 'Wilayah widget iki digunakake kanggo nambah simbol kapercayan lan lencana kapercayan ing kaca pembayaran pesenan.','Thank you page & order details layout' => 'Matur nuwun tata letak halaman &amp; rincian pesanan','Order details optimizations' => 'Optimasi rincian pesenan','Enable thank you page and order details optimizations' => 'Aktifake kaca matur nuwun lan optimasi rincian pesenan','Changes the layout of order details on the thank you page and account pages.' => 'Ngganti tata letak rincian pesenan ing kaca matur nuwun lan kaca akun.','Enable order details customizations on email notifications' => 'Aktifake kustomisasi rincian pesenan ing kabar email','Display new sections and change order of sections on email notifications. Styles of order details on email notifications remain unchanged.' => 'Tampilake bagean anyar lan ganti urutan bagean ing kabar email. Gaya rincian pesenan ing kabar email tetep ora owah.','Thank you page' => 'Matur nuwun kaca','These options affect the thank you page, also known as order received or order confirmation pages.' => 'Opsi iki mengaruhi kaca matur nuwun, uga dikenal minangka kaca pesenan sing ditampa utawa kaca konfirmasi pesenan.','Order details layout' => 'Tata letak rincian pesenan','Display the order details with wide layout on the thank you page' => 'Tampilake rincian pesenan kanthi tata letak sing amba ing kaca matur nuwun','Add widget areas to the thank you page' => 'Tambah area widget menyang kaca matur nuwun','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the thank you page.' => 'Wilayah widget iki digunakake kanggo nambah simbol kepercayaan lan lencana kepercayaan ing kaca matur nuwun.','Order actions' => 'Tumindak dhawuh','Choose in which position to display the order actions.' => 'Pilih ing posisi kanggo nampilake tumindak urutan.','Inside the order overview' => 'Ing ringkesan pesenan','After the order overview' => 'Sawise ringkesan pesenan','After order sections' => 'Sawise bagean pesenan','Order status' => 'Status pesenan','Display the order status progress bar' => 'Tampilake garis kemajuan status pesenan','Choose in which position to display the section.' => 'Pilih ing posisi kanggo nampilake bagean kasebut.','After the order overview and payment instructions' => 'Sawise ringkesan pesenan lan instruksi pembayaran','Before the order items section' => 'Sadurunge bagean pesenan item','Inside the order items section' => 'Ing bagean pesenan item','After the order items section' => 'Sawise bagean pesenan item','On the sidebar' => 'Ing sidebar','Order downloads' => 'Ngundhuh pesenan','Gift message' => 'Pesen hadiah','Tools' => 'piranti','Troubleshooting' => 'Ngatasi masalah','Debug options' => 'Pilihan debug','Debug mode' => 'Mode debug','Using debug mode affects the website performance. Only use this option while troubleshooting.' => 'Nggunakake mode debug mengaruhi kinerja situs web. Gunakake pilihan iki mung nalika ngatasi masalah.','Load unminified assets' => 'Muat aset sing ora dikurangi','Enhanced select fields' => 'Bidang pilih sing ditingkatake','Fix automatic zoom-in on form fields' => 'Ndandani zoom-in otomatis ing kolom formulir','Set <code>font-size</code> inside form fields to 16px' => 'Setel <code>font-size</code> ing kolom formulir dadi 16px','Fluid Checkout' => 'Cairan Checkout','Settings' => 'Setelan','Support' => 'Dhukungan','<a target="_blank" href="%s">Upgrade to PRO</a> to unlock more options.' => '<a target="_blank" href="%s">Nganyarke menyang PRO</a> kanggo mbukak kunci pilihan liyane.','(PRO)' => '(PRO)','(experimental)' => '(eksperimental)','Please verify your phone number.' => 'Mangga verifikasi nomer telpon.','The Bluehost Plugin' => 'Plugin Bluehost','Custom fields' => 'Kothak khusus','Enable custom shipping email field' => 'Aktifake kolom email pengiriman khusus','When enabled, the shipping email field from the Bluehost plugin will be added to the checkout form.' => 'Yen diaktifake, kolom email pengiriman saka plugin Bluehost bakal ditambahake menyang formulir checkout.','Captcha Pro by BestWebSoft' => 'Captcha Pro dening BestWebSoft','Captcha position' => 'Posisi Captcha','Define the position to display the captcha section. Some positions might not work depending on the captcha type chosen.' => 'Netepake posisi kanggo nampilake bagean captcha. Sawetara posisi bisa uga ora bisa digunakake gumantung saka jinis captcha sing dipilih.','Selecting a pickup point is required before proceeding.' => 'Milih titik pickup dibutuhake sadurunge nerusake.','Pickup point' => 'Titik pickup','Pickup point not selected yet.' => 'Titik pickup durung dipilih.','Pickup point:' => 'Titik Pickup:','Mailchimp for WooCommerce' => 'Mailchimp kanggo WooCommerce','Subscribe checkbox' => 'Langganan kothak centhang','Override the position for the subscribe checkbox on the checkout page and always display it on the contact step' => 'Ganti posisi kanggo kothak mriksa langganan ing kaca checkout lan tansah nampilake ing langkah kontak','Before Shipping Address' => 'Sadurunge Alamat Pengiriman','(originally "%s")' => '(asline &quot;%s&quot;)','After Shipping Address' => 'Sawise Alamat Pengiriman','Selecting a collection point is required when shipping with FermoPoint.' => 'Milih titik koleksi dibutuhake nalika ngirim nganggo FermoPoint.','If checked informs typos in email to users. (This feature has been disabled because Fluid Checkout offers the feature. Changes to this option will not take effect)' => 'Yen dicenthang ngandhani salah ketik ing email menyang pangguna. (Fitur iki wis dipateni amarga Fluid Checkout nawakake fitur kasebut. Owah-owahan ing pilihan iki ora bakal ditrapake)','Enable Mail Check: (disabled feature)' => 'Aktifake Priksa Mail: (fitur dipateni)','Carrier:' => 'Pembawa:','Sendinblue - WooCommerce Email Marketing' => 'Sendinblue - Pemasaran Email WooCommerce','Sign up checkbox position' => 'Ndaftar posisi kothak centhang','Move the sign up checkbox to the contact step' => 'Pindhah kothak tandha munggah menyang langkah kontak','When enabled, the checkbox will be moved to the contact step independently of the display location defined in the Sendinblue plugin settings.' => 'Yen diaktifake, kothak centhang bakal dipindhah menyang langkah kontak kanthi bebas saka lokasi tampilan sing ditetepake ing setelan plugin Sendinblue.','Theme Betheme' => 'Tema Betheme','Checkout progress' => 'kemajuan Checkout','Output the checkout steps section from Betheme on the checkout, cart and order received pages.' => 'Output bagean langkah-langkah checkout saka Betheme ing kaca checkout, cart lan pesenan sing ditampa.','Theme Fennik' => 'Tema Fennik','Breadcrumbs' => 'Breadcrumbs','Output the breadcrumbs section from the Fennik theme when using Fluid Checkout header and footer.' => 'Output bagean breadcrumbs saka tema Fennik nalika nggunakake Fluid Checkout header lan footer.','Theme Go' => 'Tema Go','My account layout' => 'Tata letak akunku','Enable wide layout on "My account" page.' => 'Aktifake tata letak amba ing kaca &quot;Akunku&quot;.','Theme Impreza' => 'Tema Impreza','Header' => 'Header','Spacing for site header at the checkout page (in pixels)' => 'Spasi kanggo header situs ing kaca checkout (ing piksel)','Only applicable when using the Impreza theme header at the checkout page.' => 'Mung ditrapake nalika nggunakake header tema Impreza ing kaca checkout.','Theme Kapee' => 'Tema Kapee','Output the checkout steps section from the Kapee theme on the checkout, cart and order received pages.' => 'Output bagean langkah checkout saka tema Kapee ing checkout, cart lan pesenan ditampa kaca.','Theme Porto' => 'Tema Porto','Output the checkout steps section from the Porto theme on the checkout, cart and order received pages.' => 'Output bagean langkah checkout saka tema Porto ing checkout, cart lan pesenan ditampa kaca.','Theme Pressmart' => 'Tema Pressmart','Output the checkout steps section from the Pressmart theme on the checkout, cart and order received pages.' => 'Output bagean langkah-langkah checkout saka tema Pressmart ing kaca checkout, cart lan pesenan sing ditampa.','Theme The Gem' => 'Tema The Gem','Output the checkout steps section from The Gem theme when using Fluid Checkout header and footer.' => 'Output bagean langkah-langkah checkout saka tema Permata nalika nggunakake header lan footer Fluid Checkout.','Theme Woodmart' => 'Tema Woodmart','Output the checkout steps section from the Woodmart theme when using Fluid Checkout header and footer.' => 'Output bagean langkah-langkah checkout saka tema Woodmart nalika nggunakake header lan footer Fluid Checkout.','Checkout options' => 'Pilihan checkout','Disable the theme checkout options' => 'Pateni opsi checkout tema','The options display product image, quantity field, remove button and link to product page added by the theme are disabled by default.' => 'Opsi nampilake gambar produk, kolom kuantitas, tombol mbusak lan link menyang kaca produk sing ditambahake kanthi tema dipateni kanthi gawan.','Theme Atomion' => 'Tema Atomion','Order progress' => 'Kemajuan pesenan','Display order progress from the theme' => 'Tampilake kemajuan urutan saka tema','Display the form field labels visible on the page' => 'Tampilake label kolom formulir sing katon ing kaca kasebut','It is recommended to keep this option enabled for a better user experience.' => 'Disaranake supaya opsi iki aktif kanggo pengalaman pangguna sing luwih apik.','Theme ZK Nito' => 'Tema ZK Nito','Add extra fields to the checkout form' => 'Tambah kothak ekstra menyang formulir checkout','Adds an extra shipping email and shipping phone field to the shipping address section.' => 'Nambahake lapangan email pengiriman lan telpon pengiriman menyang bagean alamat pengiriman.','Go to the home page' => 'Pindhah menyang kaca ngarep','Skip to content' => 'Lumpat menyang isi','Create an account' => 'Nggawe akun','Log in to your account' => 'Mlebu menyang akun sampeyan','Already have an account?' => 'Wis duwe akun?','Logged in as %1$s. <a href="%2$s">Log out</a>' => 'Mlebet minangka %1$s. <a href="%2$s">metu</a>','Your order has a total amount due of %s. No further payment is needed.' => 'Pesenan sampeyan duwe jumlah total amarga %s. Ora ana pembayaran maneh sing dibutuhake.','Close and continue with checkout' => 'Nutup lan terus karo checkout','Continue' => 'Terus','Parcel terminal' => 'Terminal paket','<p>This widget has been replaced by Fluid Checkout. </p><p>When using Fluid Checkout, the checkout page needs to use the original WooCommerce shortcode <code>[woocommerce_checkout]</code> to work properly.</p><p>For more information, visit the Fluid Checkout documentation.</p>' => '<p>Widget iki wis diganti dening Fluid Checkout.</p><p> Nalika nggunakake Fluid Checkout, kaca checkout kudu nggunakake kode cekak WooCommerce asli <code>[woocommerce_checkout]</code> supaya bisa mlaku kanthi bener.</p><p> Kanggo informasi luwih lengkap, bukak dokumentasi Fluid Checkout.</p>','Theme The7' => 'Tema 7','Additional header sections' => 'Bagean header tambahan','Output additional header sections if enabled in the theme settings.' => 'Output bagean header tambahan yen diaktifake ing setelan tema.','More information' => 'informasi liyane','Pick a Locker' => 'Pilih Locker','Page template' => 'Cithakan kaca','Use `Order confirmation` page template for block-based themes' => 'Gunakake template kaca `Konfirmasi pesenan` kanggo tema adhedhasar blok','Only applies when using a block-based theme.' => 'Mung ditrapake nalika nggunakake tema adhedhasar blok.','WooCommerce Stripe Gateway' => 'WooCommerce Stripe Gateway','Payment form' => 'Wangun pembayaran','Apply styles to the Stripe payment form fields' => 'Terapake gaya menyang kolom formulir pembayaran Stripe','When enabled, Fluid Checkout will apply styles optimized for compatibility with the plugin. You may want to disable this if you are using custom styles for the Stripe payment form fields.' => 'Yen diaktifake, Fluid Checkout bakal ngetrapake gaya sing dioptimalake kanggo kompatibilitas karo plugin kasebut. Sampeyan bisa uga pengin mateni iki yen sampeyan nggunakake gaya khusus kanggo kolom formulir pembayaran Stripe.','Theme Nyture' => 'Tema Nyatur','Output the checkout steps section from the Nyture theme when using Fluid Checkout.' => 'Output bagean langkah checkout saka tema Nyture nalika nggunakake Fluid Checkout.','Allows customers to make payments for orders that are either created manually by the store admin or not completed during checkout.' => 'Ngidini pelanggan nggawe pembayaran kanggo pesenan sing digawe kanthi manual dening admin toko utawa ora rampung nalika checkout.','The plugin WooCommerce Checkout Manager by Quadlayers is not compatible with Fluid Checkout' => 'Plugin WooCommerce Checkout Manager dening Quadlayers ora kompatibel karo Fluid Checkout','Company name field for billing address' => 'Kolom jeneng perusahaan kanggo alamat tagihan','Change visibility for the company name field for the billing address section on the checkout form.' => 'Ganti visibilitas kanggo kolom jeneng perusahaan kanggo bagean alamat tagihan ing formulir checkout.','Theme Bookshelf' => 'Tema Rak Buku','Output the checkout steps section from the Bookshelf theme when using Fluid Checkout.' => 'Output bagean langkah-langkah checkout saka tema Rak Buku nalika nggunakake Fluid Checkout.','Account password' => 'Sandi akun','An account will be created with the information provided at checkout when completing the order.' => 'Akun bakal digawe kanthi informasi sing diwenehake ing checkout nalika ngrampungake pesenan.','Choose the style of the progress bar.' => 'Pilih gaya garis kemajuan.','Bars' => 'Bar','Theme Ireca' => 'Tema Ireca','WooCommerce page layout' => 'Tata letak kaca WooCommerce','Force wide layout on WooCommerce pages' => 'Meksa tata letak sudhut ing kaca WooCommerce','This ensures the content section is not too narrow on WooCommerce pages including checkout, cart, order received, order pay and account pages.' => 'Iki njamin bagean konten ora sempit banget ing kaca WooCommerce kalebu checkout, cart, pesenan sing ditampa, pesenan mbayar lan kaca akun.','WooCommerce Smart Coupons' => 'Kupon Pintar WooCommerce','Position on checkout page' => 'Posisi ing kaca checkout','Choose where to display the available coupons section on the checkout page.' => 'Pilih ngendi kanggo nampilake bagean kupon kasedhiya ing kaca checkout.','Before the progress bar' => 'Sadurunge bar kemajuan','After the progress bar' => 'Sawise bar kemajuan','Before coupon codes section' => 'Sadurunge bagean kode coupon','Format phone numbers according to the rules for each country.' => 'Format nomer telpon miturut aturan kanggo saben negara.','Use precise phone number validation' => 'Gunakake validasi nomer telpon sing tepat','This is an experimental feature and may not work as expected in all setups. Use it with caution.' => 'Iki minangka fitur eksperimen lan bisa uga ora bisa digunakake kaya sing dikarepake ing kabeh persiyapan. Gunakake kanthi ati-ati.','Phone number validation types used when precise validation is enabled.' => 'Jinis validasi nomer telpon sing digunakake nalika validasi sing tepat diaktifake.','Mobile' => 'Seluler','Fixed line' => 'Jalur tetep','Toll free' => 'Bebas pulsa','Or' => 'Utawa','Contact' => 'Kontak','Multi step' => 'Multi langkah','2 columns' => '2 kolom','1 column' => '1 kolom','Before checkout steps' => 'Langkah-langkah sadurunge checkout','When using the <em>"1 column"</em> checkout layout this option is always set to <em>"Before checkout steps"</em> and also applies to desktop view.' => 'Nalika nggunakake tata letak checkout <em>&quot;1 kolom&quot;,</em> opsi iki mesthi disetel dadi <em>&quot;Sadurunge langkah checkout&quot;</em> lan uga ditrapake kanggo tampilan desktop.','Position for the extra order summary section on mobile.' => 'Posisi kanggo bagean ringkesan pesenan tambahan ing seluler.','The option <em>"On the site header"</em> only applies when using the distraction-free header.' => 'Opsi <em>&quot;Ing header situs&quot;</em> mung ditrapake nalika nggunakake header sing ora ana gangguan.','On the site header (requires distraction-free header)' => 'Ing header situs (mbutuhake header sing ora ngganggu)','Initial state for the expansible order summary section on mobile.' => 'Kahanan awal kanggo bagean ringkesan pesenan sing bisa ditambahi ing seluler.','We recommend setting it as <em>expanded</em> for the following countries due to regulatory requirements: <strong>Germany</strong>, <strong>Austria</strong>, <strong>Switzerland</strong>, <strong>Netherlands</strong>, <strong>Poland</strong>, <strong>Belgium</strong> and <strong>France</strong>.' => 'Disaranake nyetel minangka <em>sing wis dikembangake</em> kanggo negara-negara ing ngisor iki amarga syarat peraturan: <strong>Jerman</strong> , <strong>Austria</strong> , <strong>Swiss</strong> , <strong>Walanda</strong> , <strong>Polandia</strong> , <strong>Belgia</strong> lan <strong>Prancis</strong> .','Collapsed' => 'Ambruk','Expanded' => 'Diembangake','Do not show' => 'Aja nuduhake','yes' => 'ya','The shipping phone field may be forced as "required" if the billing address section is displayed after the shipping address section, and the billing phone field is set as "required". This is needed to ensure the shipping address can be copied to the billing address when that option is checked, otherwise the customer might not be able to complete the checkout form.' => 'Kolom nomer telpon pengiriman bisa dipeksa dadi &quot;dibutuhake&quot; yen bagean alamat tagihan ditampilake sawise bagean alamat pengiriman, lan kolom nomer telpon tagihan disetel dadi &quot;dibutuhake&quot;. Iki dibutuhake kanggo mesthekake yen alamat pengiriman bisa disalin menyang alamat tagihan nalika opsi kasebut dicenthang, yen ora, pelanggan bisa uga ora bisa ngrampungake formulir checkout.','The billing phone field may be forced as "required" if the billing address section is displayed before the shipping address section, and the shipping phone field is set as "required". This is needed to ensure the shipping address can be copied to the billing address when that option is checked, otherwise the customer might not be able to complete the checkout form.' => 'Kolom nomer telpon tagihan bisa dipeksa dadi &quot;dibutuhake&quot; yen bagean alamat tagihan ditampilake sadurunge bagean alamat pengiriman, lan kolom nomer telpon pengiriman disetel dadi &quot;dibutuhake&quot;. Iki dibutuhake kanggo mesthekake alamat pengiriman bisa disalin menyang alamat tagihan nalika opsi kasebut dicenthang, yen ora, pelanggan bisa uga ora bisa ngrampungake formulir checkout.','Settings profiles' => 'Profil setelan','Settings profile' => 'Profil setelan','You do not have permission to perform this action.' => 'Sampeyan ora duwe idin kanggo nindakake tumindak iki.','You do not have permission to activate plugins.' => 'Sampeyan ora duwe idin kanggo ngaktifake plugin.','Missing plugin.' => 'Plugin ilang.','Plugin activated.' => 'Plugin wis diaktifake.','The following changes will be applied:' => 'Owah-owahan ing ngisor iki bakal ditrapake:','Since Fluid Checkout 5.0, settings are saved differently. Legacy options are still stored in the database to allow downgrades to previous versions if needed.' => 'Wiwit Fluid Checkout 5.0, setelan disimpen kanthi beda. Opsi lawas isih disimpen ing basis data kanggo ngidini downgrade menyang versi sadurunge yen prelu.','Your store has been running for about 2 weeks on the new settings so you could clean up legacy options stored in the database. Please note that after cleanup, if you need to downgrade to previous versions of the plugin it will use default values for all settings.' => 'Toko sampeyan wis mlaku udakara 2 minggu nganggo setelan anyar supaya sampeyan bisa ngresiki opsi lawas sing disimpen ing basis data. Elinga yen sawise ngresiki, yen sampeyan kudu mudhun menyang versi plugin sadurunge, bakal nggunakake nilai standar kanggo kabeh setelan.','Fluid Checkout settings cleanup' => 'Reresik setelan Fluid Checkout','Delete leftover options' => 'Busak opsi sing isih ana','Help us improve Fluid Checkout' => 'Tulungi kita ningkatake Fluid Checkout','Share anonymous site environment reports with Fluid Checkout to get faster support and help us improve compatibility and measure impact. No customer, user, or sensitive data are included. You can choose what is shared anytime from the Tools settings.' => 'Nuduhake laporan lingkungan situs anonim karo Fluid Checkout kanggo entuk dhukungan sing luwih cepet lan mbantu kita ningkatake kompatibilitas lan ngukur dampak. Ora ana data pelanggan, pangguna, utawa sensitif sing kalebu. Sampeyan bisa milih apa sing dienggo bareng kapan wae saka setelan Piranti.','Enable site environment reports' => 'Aktifake laporan lingkungan situs','Review settings' => 'Tinjau setelan','This preview has expired. Reload the admin page to start a new preview.' => 'Pratayang iki wis kadaluwarsa. Muat maneh kaca admin kanggo miwiti pratayang anyar.','Preview expired' => 'Pratinjau wis kadaluwarsa','Orders cannot be placed in the preview.' => 'Pesenan ora bisa dilebokake ing pratinjau.','Logging in is not available in the preview.' => 'Mlebu ora kasedhiya ing pratinjau.','Accounts cannot be created in the preview.' => 'Akun ora bisa digawe ing pratinjau.','Requests to other sites are blocked in the preview.' => 'Panjaluk menyang situs liya diblokir ing pratinjau.','Processing…' => 'Ngolah…','Something went wrong. Please try again.' => 'Ana sing ora beres. Coba maneh.','Activate plugin' => 'Aktifake plugin','Fluid Checkout PRO - The complete checkout package' => 'Fluid Checkout PRO - Paket checkout lengkap','All PRO features + all add-ons, one price. Design templates, optimized cart and order received pages, account matching, and much more.' => 'Kabeh fitur PRO + kabeh tambahan, siji rega. Cithakan desain, kaca kranjang lan pesenan sing dioptimalake, pencocokan akun, lan liya-liyane.','Optimized order pay page' => 'Kaca pambayaran pesenan sing dioptimalake','Express checkout buttons from supported payment methods' => 'Tombol checkout cepet saka metode pembayaran sing didhukung','Delayed account creation' => 'Nggawe akun telat','Address autocomplete with Google Maps APIs' => 'Alamat otomatis dilengkapake nganggo API Google Maps','Multiple saved addresses with the address book' => 'Alamat sing disimpen nganggo buku alamat pirang-pirang','EU-VAT assistant' => 'Asisten EU-PPN','Hide this section' => 'Ndhelikake bagean iki','Learn more' => 'Sinau luwih lengkap','Get early access' => 'Entuk akses awal','Activate add-on' => 'Aktifake tambahan','Get more out of your checkout journey' => 'Entuk luwih akeh manfaat saka perjalanan checkout sampeyan','Test API key' => 'Kunci API uji coba','Guided setup' => 'Persiapan sing dipandu','Options' => 'Pilihan','Set up layout and design on the <a href="%s">checkout options</a>.' => 'Atur tata letak lan desain ing <a href="%s">opsi checkout</a> .','Enable guest checkout and/or review <a href="%s">customer accounts settings</a>.' => 'Aktifake checkout tamu lan/utawa deleng <a href="%s">setelan akun pelanggan</a> .','Enable optimized <a href="%1$s">cart</a>, <a href="%2$s">thank you</a> and <a href="%3$s">order pay</a> pages.' => 'Aktifake <a href="%1$s">kaca kranjang</a> sing dioptimalake, <a href="%2$s">matur nuwun</a> , lan <a href="%3$s">pembayaran pesenan</a> .','Enable <a href="%s">address autocomplete</a> from Google Maps.' => 'Aktifake <a href="%s">pelengkapan alamat otomatis</a> saka Google Maps.','Enable multiple saved addresses with <a href="%s">address book</a>.' => 'Aktifake pirang-pirang alamat sing disimpen nganggo <a href="%s">buku alamat</a> .','Check if there are any <a href="%s">integration options</a> available for the theme or other plugins you have installed.' => 'Priksa manawa ana <a href="%s">opsi integrasi</a> sing kasedhiya kanggo tema utawa plugin liyane sing wis diinstal.','Get faster support and help us improve compatibility and measure impact. <a href="%s">Enable usage tracking</a> from the tools settings.' => 'Entuk dhukungan sing luwih cepet lan tulungi kita ningkatake kompatibilitas lan ngukur dampak. <a href="%s">Aktifake pelacakan panggunaan</a> saka setelan piranti.','Missing settings tab.' => 'Tab setelan ilang.','Getting started' => 'Miwiti','<strong>Great! Your checkout page is now running on Fluid Checkout.</strong> Here are a few steps to get started:' => '<strong>Apik! Kaca pembayaran sampeyan saiki wis mlaku ing Fluid Checkout.</strong> Iki sawetara langkah kanggo miwiti:','Completed' => 'Rampung','Preview report data' => 'Pratinjau data laporan','Send now' => 'Kirim saiki','Auto-detect' => 'Deteksi otomatis','Afrikaans' => 'Basa Afrikaans','Albanian' => 'Basa Albania','Amharic' => 'Basa Amharik','Arabic' => 'Basa Arab','Armenian' => 'Armenia','Azerbaijani' => 'Basa Azerbaijan','Basque' => 'Basa Basque','Belarusian' => 'Basa Belarusia','Bengali' => 'Basa Bengali','Bosnian' => 'Basa Bosnia','Bulgarian' => 'Basa Bulgaria','Burmese' => 'Wong Burma','Catalan' => 'Basa Katalan','Chinese' => 'Cina','Chinese (Simplified)' => 'Basa Cina (Sederhana)','Chinese (Hong Kong)' => 'Wong Tionghoa (Hong Kong)','Chinese (Traditional)' => 'Basa Cina (Tradisional)','Croatian' => 'Kroasia','Czech' => 'Ceko','Danish' => 'basa Denmark','Dutch' => 'Walanda','English' => 'Basa Inggris','English (Australian)' => 'Inggris (Australia)','English (Great Britain)' => 'Inggris (Britania Raya)','Estonian' => 'Basa Estonia','Farsi' => 'Basa Persia','Finnish' => 'Basa Finlandia','Filipino' => 'Wong Filipina','French' => 'Prancis','French (Canadian)' => 'Prancis (Kanada)','Galician' => 'Galicia','Georgian' => 'Georgia','German' => 'Jerman','Greek' => 'Yunani','Gujarati' => 'Basa Gujarati','Hebrew' => 'Ibrani','Hindi' => 'Hindi','Hungarian' => 'Wong Hongaria','Icelandic' => 'Islandia','Indonesian' => 'Basa Indonesia','Italian' => 'Italia','Japanese' => 'Jepang','Kannada' => 'Basa Kannada','Kazakh' => 'Kazakh','Khmer' => 'Khmer','Korean' => 'Korea','Kyrgyz' => 'Kirgiz','Lao' => 'Lao','Latvian' => 'Basa Latvia','Lithuanian' => 'Lithuania','Macedonian' => 'Makedonia','Malay' => 'Melayu','Malayalam' => 'Malayalam','Marathi' => 'Marathi','Mongolian' => 'Wong Mongolia','Nepali' => 'Wong Nepal','Norwegian' => 'Basa Norwegia','Polish' => 'Polandia','Portuguese' => 'Portugis','Portuguese (Brazil)' => 'Basa Portugis (Brasil)','Portuguese (Portugal)' => 'Basa Portugis (Portugal)','Punjabi' => 'Punjabi','Romanian' => 'Wong Rumania','Russian' => 'Rusia','Serbian' => 'Basa Serbia','Sinhalese' => 'Wong Sinhala','Slovak' => 'Slowakia','Slovenian' => 'Basa Slovenia','Spanish' => 'Spanyol','Spanish (Latin America)' => 'Spanyol (Amerika Latin)','Swahili' => 'Basa Swahili','Swedish' => 'Swedia','Tamil' => 'Tamil','Telugu' => 'Telugu','Thai' => 'Wong Thailand','Turkish' => 'Turki','Ukrainian' => 'Ukraina','Urdu' => 'Basa Urdu','Vietnamese' => 'Wong Vietnam','Zulu' => 'Zulu','Google address autocomplete' => 'Alamat Google otomatis dilengkapake','Google Places API version' => 'Versi API Google Places','Choose which version of the Google Places API to use. We recommend moving to the new Places API as soon as possible.' => 'Pilih versi Google Places API sing arep digunakake. Disaranake sampeyan pindhah menyang Places API anyar sanalika bisa.','We recommend using "Places API (New)" as effective March 1, 2025, Google will move the "Places API (Legacy)" version into Legacy status, meaning you will no longer be able to enable this service for new API keys and that that version of the API will eventually not be available anymore. Existing accounts already using the Legacy API may continue to work without disruptions.' => 'Disaranake nggunakake &quot;Places API (Anyar)&quot; wiwit 1 Maret 2025, Google bakal mindhah versi &quot;Places API (Legacy)&quot; menyang status Legacy, tegese sampeyan ora bakal bisa ngaktifake layanan iki kanggo kunci API anyar lan versi API kasebut pungkasane ora bakal kasedhiya maneh. Akun sing wis ana nggunakake Legacy API bisa terus bisa digunakake tanpa gangguan.','(Recommended)' => '(Disaranake)','Google API key' => 'Kunci API Google','Paste your Google API key and use the test button to confirm it works for this website. Make sure the key is valid and allowed for your domain, otherwise the address field might get blocked preventing customers from completing their orders.' => 'Tempel kunci API Google sampeyan lan gunakake tombol tes kanggo ngonfirmasi yen bisa digunakake kanggo situs web iki. Priksa manawa kunci kasebut valid lan diidini kanggo domain sampeyan, yen ora, kolom alamat bisa diblokir supaya pelanggan ora bisa ngrampungake pesenan.','Enable Google address autocomplete' => 'Aktifake alamat Google sing dilengkapake otomatis','Enable address autocompletion using the Google Maps APIs.' => 'Aktifake pelengkapan otomatis alamat nggunakake Google Maps API.','Google API language' => 'Basa API Google','This language will be used to display the Google Places API address suggestions and addresses will also be autocompleted in this language.' => 'Basa iki bakal digunakake kanggo nampilake saran alamat Google Places API lan alamat uga bakal dirampungake kanthi otomatis ing basa iki.','Result types' => 'Jinis asil','Leave empty to accept any type of results, which usually yields better matching results. <a href="%s" target="_blank">See documentation for more details</a>. <br>Select up to 5 types of address search results to return on address autocomplete fields. <br>Visit the Google Maps documentation to learn more about the <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-types" target="_blank">supported types</a>.' => 'Kosongna wae kanggo nampa asil apa wae, sing biasane ngasilake asil sing cocog. <a href="%s" target="_blank">Deleng dokumentasi kanggo rincian liyane</a> .<br> Pilih nganti 5 jinis asil panelusuran alamat kanggo ngasilake kolom pelengkapan otomatis alamat.<br> Bukak dokumentasi Google Maps kanggo mangerteni sing luwih lengkap babagan <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-types" target="_blank">jinis sing didhukung</a> .','Result types (Legacy API)' => 'Jinis asil (API Legacy)','Which type of address search results to return when using Places API (Legacy). <br>Visit the documentation of the Legacy Google Places API to learn more about the <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service/supported_types#table3" target="_blank">supported types</a>.' => 'Jinis asil panelusuran alamat sing kudu dibalekake nalika nggunakake Places API (Legacy).<br> Bukak dokumentasi Legacy Google Places API kanggo mangerteni sing luwih lengkap babagan <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service/supported_types#table3" target="_blank">jinis sing didhukung</a> .','Company fields' => 'Lapangan perusahaan','Enable autocomplete for the company name if available' => 'Aktifake pelengkapan otomatis kanggo jeneng perusahaan yen kasedhiya','Enable autocompletion of the company field with the company name information when returned from the Google Maps APIs.' => 'Aktifake pelengkapan otomatis kolom perusahaan nganggo informasi jeneng perusahaan nalika bali saka Google Maps API.','Business search' => 'Panelusuran bisnis','Enable search for businesses in the company field' => 'Aktifake panelusuran bisnis ing kolom perusahaan','Enable suggestion of addresses associated with a business when typing in the company field, then autocomplete all addresses fields when a business is selected from the suggestions.' => 'Aktifake saran alamat sing ana gandhengane karo bisnis nalika ngetik ing kolom perusahaan, banjur isi otomatis kabeh kolom alamat nalika bisnis dipilih saka saran kasebut.','Company result types' => 'Jinis asil perusahaan','Select up to 5 types of address search results to return on autocomplete company fields. <br>Recommended value is <code>establishment</code>, which includes most types of businesses. <br>Leave empty to accept any type of results, including results that are not related to businesses. <br>Visit the Google Maps documentation to learn more about the <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-types" target="_blank">supported types</a>.' => 'Pilih nganti 5 jinis asil panelusuran alamat kanggo ngasilake kolom perusahaan sing dilengkapake otomatis.<br> Nilai sing disaranake yaiku <code>establishment</code> , sing kalebu umume jinis bisnis.<br> Kosongna wae kanggo nampa asil apa wae, kalebu asil sing ora ana gandhengane karo bisnis.<br> Bukak dokumentasi Google Maps kanggo mangerteni sing luwih lengkap babagan <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-types" target="_blank">jinis sing didhukung</a> .','Google logo' => 'Logo Google','Show text and logo "Powered by Google"' => 'Tampilake teks lan logo &quot;Didukung dening Google&quot;','When checked, the text and logo "Powered by Google" will be displayed at the bottom of the address autocomplete suggestions box.' => 'Nalika dicenthang, teks lan logo &quot;Powered by Google&quot; bakal ditampilake ing sisih ngisor kothak saran pelengkapan otomatis alamat.','Brasil API address autocomplete' => 'Alamat API Brasil otomatis dilengkapake','Brasil API' => 'API Brasil','Enable Brasil API address autocomplete for CEP fields' => 'Aktifake alamat API Brasil sing dilengkapake otomatis kanggo kolom CEP','Use Brasil API to retrieve and autofill addresses using the CEP/Postcode field. Only relevant for Brazilian addresses.' => 'Gunakna Brasil API kanggo njupuk lan ngisi alamat kanthi otomatis nggunakake kolom CEP/Kode Pos. Mung cocog kanggo alamat Brasil.','API version' => 'Versi API','Choose which version of the Brasil API CEP method to use.' => 'Pilih versi metode CEP Brasil API sing arep digunakake.','Address book migration' => 'Migrasi buku alamat','WooCommerce addresses' => 'Alamat WooCommerce','Copy existing shipping and billing addresses from WooCommerce into the customers\' address book.' => 'Salin alamat pengiriman lan tagihan sing wis ana saka WooCommerce menyang buku alamat pelanggan.','Enable the address book feature' => 'Aktifake fitur buku alamat','Allow customers to save multiple addresses and define the default address to be used for shipping and billing.' => 'Ngidini pelanggan nyimpen pirang-pirang alamat lan nemtokake alamat gawan sing bakal digunakake kanggo pengiriman lan tagihan.','Address labels' => 'Label alamat','Allow customers to add a custom label for each address' => 'Ngidini pelanggan nambahake label khusus kanggo saben alamat','Address labels make it easier to for customers to distinguish between their saved addresses (ie.: "Mom\'s House"). The address labels are private to the customers, and will not be displayed or printed on the order details page or invoices.' => 'Label alamat nggampangake para pelanggan mbedakake antarane alamat sing disimpen (kayata: &quot;Omah Ibu&quot;). Label alamat kasebut pribadi kanggo para pelanggan, lan ora bakal ditampilake utawa dicithak ing kaca rincian pesenan utawa faktur.','Display layout' => 'Tata letak tampilan','Choose how saved addresses are displayed at checkout and on the cart.' => 'Pilih kepiye alamat sing disimpen bakal ditampilake nalika checkout lan ing kranjang.','Applies at checkout and on the cart. Saved addresses on the account page always use the cards layout.' => 'Ditrapake nalika checkout lan ing kranjang. Alamat sing disimpen ing kaca akun mesthi nggunakake tata letak kertu.','Address cards' => 'Kartu alamat','Address list' => 'Daftar alamat','Dropdown field' => 'Kolom gulung mudhun','Address search' => 'Panelusuran alamat','Show address search filter on frontend when customer has at least this number of saved addresses available.' => 'Tampilake filter telusuran alamat ing frontend nalika pelanggan duwe paling ora jumlah alamat sing disimpen iki.','Not used when display layout is set to dropdown field.' => 'Ora digunakake nalika tata letak tampilan disetel menyang kolom gulung mudhun.','Addresses' => 'Alamat','Enable cart page optimizations to see more options' => 'Aktifake optimasi kaca kranjang kanggo ndeleng opsi liyane','Sticky order summary' => 'Ringkesan pesenan sing tetep','Select position where to display the coupon codes section on the cart page. Only applicable when AJAX cart is enabled, and if use of coupon codes are enabled in the WooCommerce settings.' => 'Pilih posisi ing ngendi bagean kode kupon bakal ditampilake ing kaca kranjang. Mung ditrapake nalika kranjang AJAX diaktifake, lan yen panggunaan kode kupon diaktifake ing setelan WooCommerce.','Layout of cross-sell' => 'Tata letak penjualan silang','Cross-sells displayed' => 'Penjualan silang ditampilake','Items' => 'Barang-barang','Cart page optimization' => 'Optimisasi kaca kranjang','Give your cart the same clear, conversion-focused layout as your checkout.' => 'Wenehana tata letak sing jelas lan fokus ing konversi sing padha karo tata letak kasir sampeyan.','Match the cart layout to the checkout page for a consistent purchase journey.' => 'Cocokake tata letak kranjang karo kaca pembayaran supaya proses tuku konsisten.','Keep the cart always updated in the background, no full page reloads when quantities change.' => 'Tansah nganyari kranjang ing latar mburi, ora ana muat ulang kaca lengkap nalika jumlah owah.','Place coupon codes, shipping, and cross-sells exactly where they convert best.' => 'Selehake kode kupon, pengiriman, lan penjualan silang persis ing ngendi kode kasebut paling apik dikonversi.','Keep the order summary visible while scrolling, and add trust symbols where shoppers need reassurance.' => 'Jaga ringkesan pesenan tetep katon nalika nggulung, lan tambahake simbol kepercayaan ing ngendi para pembeli butuh kepastian.','Columns' => 'Kolom','General styles for the checkout steps, order summary and other sections. Applies to other checkout, cart, thank you (order received), and view order pages.' => 'Gaya umum kanggo langkah-langkah checkout, ringkesan pesenan, lan bagean liyane. Ditrapake kanggo checkout liyane, kranjang, matur nuwun (pesenan ditampa), lan ndeleng kaca pesenan.','When using the <em>"1 column"</em> layout with the <em>"Split"</em> design template, a right column is shown only if the page sidebar widget area is active (Checkout Sidebar, Cart Sidebar, or Order Received Sidebar). Otherwise the page stays as a single column with Split styles.' => 'Nalika nggunakake tata letak <em>&quot;1 kolom&quot;</em> karo cithakan desain <em>&quot;Pisah&quot;</em> , kolom tengen mung ditampilake yen area widget sidebar kaca aktif (Checkout Sidebar, Cart Sidebar, utawa Order Received Sidebar). Yen ora, kaca tetep dadi siji kolom nganggo gaya Pisah.','Split column background' => 'Latar mburi kolom sing dipérang','Choose a background color for the Split design secondary column. Leave empty to use the order summary background color.' => 'Pilih werna latar mburi kanggo kolom sekunder Desain pamisah. Kosongna wae kanggo nggunakake werna latar mburi ringkesan pesenan.','Page templates' => 'Cithakan kaca','Checkout template' => 'Cithakan pambayaran','Recommended for fewer distractions at checkout. <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/cart-abandonment" target="_blank">Read the research about cart abandonment</a>.' => 'Disaranake kanggo ngurangi gangguan nalika mbayar. <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/cart-abandonment" target="_blank">Wacanen riset babagan ninggalake kranjang</a> .','Sticky progress bar' => 'Bilah kemajuan sing lengket','Progress bar style' => 'Gaya bilah kemajuan','Order totals' => 'Total pesenan','Background color' => 'Werna latar mburi','Action link' => 'Pranala tumindak','Mobile order summary' => 'Ringkesan pesenan seluler','Mobile initial state' => 'Kahanan awal seluler','Enable editing cart items at checkout' => 'Aktifake panyuntingan item kranjang nalika checkout','Allow customers to change product quantities or remove items directly at the checkout page.' => 'Ngidini pelanggan ngganti jumlah produk utawa mbusak barang langsung ing kaca checkout.','Cart item errors' => 'Kasalahan barang kranjang','Only applicable when coupon code is displayed as a separate section on the checkout or cart pages, and if use of coupon codes are enabled in the WooCommerce settings.' => 'Mung ditrapake nalika kode kupon ditampilake minangka bagean sing kapisah ing kaca checkout utawa kranjang, lan yen panggunaan kode kupon diaktifake ing setelan WooCommerce.','Coupon codes position' => 'Posisi kode kupon','Apply coupon button' => 'Tombol aplikasi kupon','Select style of the "apply coupon" button.' => 'Pilih gaya tombol &quot;aplikasi kupon&quot;.','Address line 2' => 'Baris alamat 2','This setting is shared between the Checkout and Local pickup sections. On the Local pickup section, it also decides whether the Ship/Pickup selector shows inside the shipping method section (before the address) or as a separate section (after).' => 'Setelan iki dienggo bareng antarane bagean Checkout lan Pickup lokal. Ing bagean Pickup lokal, setelan iki uga nemtokake apa pemilih Ship/Pickup ditampilake ing njero bagean metode pengiriman (sadurunge alamat) utawa minangka bagean sing kapisah (sawise).','Customer accounts' => 'Akun pelanggan','Guest checkout' => 'Tamu sing mbayar','Guest checkout, login, and account creation options from the WooCommerce Accounts settings page. They are managed here for your convenience, and so you can use different values per settings profile.' => 'Pilihan checkout tamu, login, lan nggawe akun saka kaca setelan Akun WooCommerce. Kabeh mau dikelola ing kene kanggo penak sampeyan, mula sampeyan bisa nggunakake nilai sing beda-beda saben profil setelan.','Allow customers to checkout without an account' => 'Ngidini pelanggan mbayar tanpa akun','<strong>Recommended</strong> so customers are not asked to create an account or log in during checkout, which can lower conversion rates.' => '<strong>Disaranake</strong> supaya pelanggan ora dijaluk nggawe akun utawa mlebu log nalika checkout, sing bisa nyuda tingkat konversi.','When disabled, customers must log in or create an account to complete the purchase.' => 'Nalika dipateni, pelanggan kudu mlebu log utawa nggawe akun kanggo ngrampungake tumbasan.','Login at checkout' => 'Mlebu nalika mbayar','Enable log-in during checkout' => 'Aktifake login nalika checkout','Show a link for returning customers to log in from the checkout page.' => 'Tampilake pranala kanggo pelanggan sing bali supaya bisa mlebu saka kaca pembayaran.','Account creation' => 'Nggawe akun','Allow customers to create an account during checkout' => 'Ngidini pelanggan nggawe akun nalika checkout','Customers can create an account before placing their order.' => 'Pelanggan bisa nggawe akun sadurunge nggawe pesenan.','Allow customers to create an account from the My account page' => 'Ngidini pelanggan nggawe akun saka kaca Akunku','Customers can register a new account from the My account page.' => 'Pelanggan bisa ndhaftar akun anyar saka kaca Akunku.','Username' => 'Jeneng panganggo','Generate from customer\'s name' => 'Nggawe saka jeneng pelanggan','<strong>Recommended</strong> so customers are not asked to choose a username during checkout, which can lower conversion rates.' => '<strong>Disaranake</strong> supaya pelanggan ora dijaluk milih jeneng panganggo nalika checkout, sing bisa nyuda tingkat konversi.','A username is generated from the customer name, or from the email address when a name cannot be used.' => 'Jeneng panganggo digawe saka jeneng pelanggan, utawa saka alamat email nalika jeneng ora bisa digunakake.','Password' => 'Sandi','Send password setup link' => 'Kirim pranala persiyapan sandhi','<strong>Recommended</strong> so customers are not asked to set a password during checkout, which can lower conversion rates.' => '<strong>Disaranake</strong> supaya pelanggan ora dijaluk nyetel sandhi nalika checkout, sing bisa nyuda tingkat konversi.','Customers receive an email to create their password securely.' => 'Pelanggan nampa email kanggo nggawe sandhi kanthi aman.','Let registered customers complete checkout without logging in and associate the order with their existing account when contact details match.' => 'Ngidini pelanggan sing wis ndhaptar ngrampungake pembayaran tanpa kudu mlebu log lan nggandhengake pesenan karo akun sing wis ana nalika rincian kontak cocog.','Existing account message' => 'Pesen akun sing wis ana','Let customers create an account after placing their order, from the thank you page.' => 'Ngidini para pelanggan nggawe akun sawise nggawe pesenan, saka kaca matur nuwun.','Options in this section are available when guest checkout and account matching are enabled. Enable both features above to configure delayed account creation.' => 'Opsi ing bagean iki kasedhiya nalika checkout tamu lan pencocokan akun diaktifake. Aktifake loro fitur ing ndhuwur kanggo ngonfigurasi nggawe akun sing ditundha.','Enable delayed account creation' => 'Aktifake nggawe akun sing ditundha','Enable delayed account creation when both guest checkout and account matching are enabled.' => 'Aktifake proses nggawe akun sing ditundha nalika checkout tamu lan pencocokan akun diaktifake.','Section position' => 'Posisi bagean','Before customer details section' => 'Sadurunge bagean rincian pelanggan','After customer details section' => 'Sawise bagean rincian pelanggan','Account creation benefits' => 'Keuntungan nggawe akun','Leaving the field empty will display the default text.' => 'Ninggalake kolom kosong bakal nampilake teks gawan.','Inline buttons' => 'Tombol-tombol ing njero','Required fields' => 'Kolom sing dibutuhake','Enable gift message fields at checkout' => 'Aktifake kolom pesen hadiah nalika checkout','Expanded gift message' => 'Pesen hadiah sing ditambahi','Display gift message field always expanded' => 'Tampilake kolom pesen hadiah sing tansah ditambahi','Gift message in order details' => 'Pesen hadiah ing rincian pesenan','No integrations available at the moment on this section. The options related to each plugin and theme will only appear here when that plugin or theme is activated.' => 'Ora ana integrasi sing kasedhiya ing bagean iki saiki. Opsi sing ana gandhengane karo saben plugin lan tema mung bakal katon ing kene nalika plugin utawa tema kasebut diaktifake.','Phone fields' => 'Kolom telpon','Field visibility' => 'Visibilitas lapangan','Field position' => 'Posisi lapangan','Phone country code & validation' => 'Kode negara telpon &amp; validasi','Country' => 'Negara','Enable country on phone fields' => 'Aktifake kolom negara ing telpon','Filter countries for shipping or billing' => 'Filter negara kanggo pengiriman utawa tagihan','Limit the country selector on each phone field to the countries allowed for shipping or billing on your store.' => 'Watesi pamilih negara ing saben kolom telpon mung ing negara sing diidini kanggo pengiriman utawa tagihan ing toko sampeyan.','Validation' => 'Validasi','Enable simple validation based on country rules' => 'Aktifake validasi prasaja adhedhasar aturan negara','Checks that the phone number is valid for the selected country, including country code and length.' => 'Priksa manawa nomer telpon valid kanggo negara sing dipilih, kalebu kode negara lan dawane.','Stricter check that the number is a valid mobile, fixed line, or other accepted type for the selected country. May reject some valid numbers.' => 'Priksa luwih ketat manawa nomer kasebut minangka nomer seluler, telpon tetep, utawa jinis liyane sing ditampa kanggo negara sing dipilih. Bisa uga nolak sawetara nomer sing valid.','Validation types' => 'Jinis validasi','Placeholders' => 'Panggonan panggon','No license keys to manage at the moment. License keys will appear here when a licensed Fluid Checkout plugin or add-on is active.' => 'Ora ana kunci lisensi sing kudu dikelola saiki. Kunci lisensi bakal katon ing kene nalika plugin utawa add-on Fluid Checkout sing dilisensi aktif.','Default delivery type' => 'Jinis pangiriman gawan','Choose which delivery type will be selected by default.' => 'Pilih jinis pangiriman sing bakal dipilih kanthi gawan.','Shipping zone fields' => 'Lapangan zona pengiriman','Choose which fields will be displayed for the local pickup shipping zone filter fields. Leave empty to show all available options.' => 'Pilih kolom endi sing bakal ditampilake kanggo kolom filter zona pengiriman pengambilan lokal. Kosongake kanggo nuduhake kabeh pilihan sing kasedhiya.','These fields will be displayed as a filter for the local pickup shipping methods. Some fields might still appear at checkout when not selected here, if compatible plugins require them to work properly.' => 'Kolom-kolom iki bakal ditampilake minangka filter kanggo metode pengiriman pengambilan lokal. Sawetara kolom isih bisa katon nalika checkout nalika ora dipilih ing kene, yen plugin sing kompatibel mbutuhake supaya bisa digunakake kanthi bener.','Order shipping address' => 'Alamat pangiriman pesenan','Order pay page optimization' => 'Optimisasi kaca pembayaran pesenan','Give unpaid orders the same clear, conversion-focused layout as checkout.' => 'Wenehana tata letak sing jelas lan fokus ing konversi sing padha karo tata letak pembayaran kanggo pesenan sing durung dibayar.','Optimize the layout of the order pay page for orders pending payment.' => 'Optimalake tata letak kaca pambayaran pesenan kanggo pesenan sing lagi ditundha pembayaran.','Match the order pay experience to your checkout for a consistent purchase journey.' => 'Cocokake pengalaman mbayar pesenan karo proses pembayaran sampeyan kanggo entuk pengalaman tuku sing konsisten.','Add trust symbols and badges where shoppers need reassurance before paying.' => 'Tambahna simbol lan lencana kepercayaan ing ngendi para pembeli butuh kepastian sadurunge mbayar.','Thank you page optimization' => 'Matur nuwun kanggo optimasi kaca','Make the thank you page and order details clearer for customers after they buy.' => 'Gawe kaca matur nuwun lan rincian pesenan supaya luwih jelas kanggo para pelanggan sawise tuku.','Optimize the thank you page and account order details with a clearer layout.' => 'Optimalake kaca matur nuwun lan rincian pesenan akun nganggo tata letak sing luwih jelas.','Show order status progress, actions, downloads, and notes where they make sense.' => 'Tampilake kemajuan status pesenan, tumindak, unduhan, lan cathetan ing ngendi wae sing masuk akal.','Customize order details sections on email notifications.' => 'Atur bagean rincian pesenan ing kabar email.','Add trust symbols and badges where shoppers need reassurance after purchase.' => 'Tambahna simbol lan lencana kepercayaan ing ngendi para pembeli butuh kepastian sawise tuku.','Email notifications' => 'Kabar liwat email','Enable thank you page and order details optimizations to see more options' => 'Aktifake kaca matur nuwun lan optimasi rincian pesenan kanggo ndeleng opsi liyane','Use wide layout on thank you page' => 'Gunakake tata letak sing amba ing kaca matur nuwun','These options affect the thank you page, view order details on account pages and on email notifications.' => 'Opsi iki mengaruhi kaca matur nuwun, ndeleng rincian pesenan ing kaca akun, lan ing kabar email.','Save settings' => 'Simpen setelan','Docs' => 'Dokumen','Cart' => 'Kranjang','Thank you' => 'Matur nuwun','Address autocomplete' => 'Alamat otomatis dirampungake','Trust badges' => 'Lencana kepercayaan','You do not have permission to save these settings.' => 'Sampeyan ora duwe idin kanggo nyimpen setelan iki.','Invalid save request.' => 'Panjaluk panyimpenan ora valid.','Your settings have been saved.' => 'Setelan sampeyan wis disimpen.','Saving...' => 'Nyimpen...','Settings could not be saved. Please try again.' => 'Setelan ora bisa disimpen. Coba maneh.','Dismiss notice' => 'Notifikasi penolakan','Open settings menu' => 'Bukak menu setelan','Close settings menu' => 'Tutup menu setelan','Preview' => 'Pratinjau','Expand preview' => 'Jembarna pratinjau','Collapse preview' => 'Ciutkan pratinjau','Show header and footer' => 'Tampilake header lan footer','Hide header and footer' => 'Ndhelikake header lan footer','Page preview' => 'Pratinjau kaca','Preview viewport' => 'Pratinjau tampilan port','Tablet' => 'Tablet','Desktop' => 'Desktop','Preview width' => 'Ambane pratinjau','Decrease width' => 'Kurangi jembar','Preview width in pixels' => 'Ambane pratinjau ing piksel','Increase width' => 'Tambah ambane','Preview as' => 'Pratinjau minangka','Guest' => 'Tamu','Logged in' => 'Wis mlebu log','Preview page' => 'Kaca pratinjau','Expand preview for a closer look' => 'Bukak pratinjau kanggo ndeleng luwih cetha','Available with %s.' => 'Kasedhiya karo %s.','Turn them on' => 'Uripake','Optimizations for this page are turned off. %s to preview the page.' => 'Optimisasi kanggo kaca iki dipateni. %s kanggo ndeleng pratinjau kaca kasebut.','%s preview' => 'Pratinjau %s','Isolated session · nothing is saved' => 'Sesi sing kapisah · ora ana sing disimpen','Usage tracking' => 'Pelacakan panggunaan','Send non-sensitive site environment reports to help Fluid Checkout improve compatibility. Reports are not sent until enabled in the options below.' => 'Kirim laporan lingkungan situs sing ora sensitif kanggo mbantu Fluid Checkout ningkatake kompatibilitas. Laporan ora dikirim nganti diaktifake ing opsi ing ngisor iki.','Send usage tracking reports to Fluid Checkout' => 'Kirim laporan pelacakan panggunaan menyang Fluid Checkout','These reports help us improve compatibility and support for your site and are sent weekly when enabled.' => 'Laporan iki mbantu kita ningkatake kompatibilitas lan dhukungan kanggo situs sampeyan lan dikirim saben minggu nalika diaktifake.','No customer, admin user, or any other sensitive data is included in the reports.' => 'Ora ana pelanggan, panganggo admin, utawa data sensitif liyane sing kalebu ing laporan kasebut.','Basic environment info' => 'Informasi lingkungan dhasar','WordPress, PHP, WooCommerce, theme, and plugin list data. Always included when reporting is enabled. Helps us understand the environment your site is running in.' => 'Data dhaptar WordPress, PHP, WooCommerce, tema, lan plugin. Tansah kalebu nalika pelaporan diaktifake. Mbantu kita mangerteni lingkungan sing digunakake situs sampeyan.','Plugin settings' => 'Setelan plugin','Sends Fluid Checkout plugin settings to help with support requests and helps us understand how you are using our plugins.' => 'Ngirim setelan plugin Fluid Checkout kanggo mbantu panjaluk dhukungan lan mbantu kita ngerti kepiye sampeyan nggunakake plugin kita.','Coming soon' => 'Bakal teka rauh','Sales metrics' => 'Metrik dodolan','Monthly order count and total sales for one year prior to installing Fluid Checkout up to today. Helps us understand if you are making more money with our plugins installed. No customer or user data is ever sent.' => 'Cacah pesenan saben wulan lan total dodolan sajrone setaun sadurunge nginstal Fluid Checkout nganti saiki. Mbantu kita ngerti apa sampeyan entuk dhuwit luwih akeh nganggo plugin sing diinstal. Ora ana data pelanggan utawa pangguna sing dikirim.','Utilities' => 'Utilitas','Use <code>TomSelect</code> dropdown components instead of <code>select2</code>' => 'Gunakake komponen gulung mudhun <code>TomSelect</code> tinimbang <code>select2</code>','TomSelect is a simpler dropdown selection component which is less prone to errors than Select2, while offering the same functionality.' => 'TomSelect kuwi komponen pilihan dropdown sing luwih prasaja sing kurang rawan kesalahan tinimbang Select2, nanging nawakake fungsi sing padha.','Sets the font size inside form fields to 16px on pages optimized by this plugin to avoid automatically zooming in when interacting with form fields on small devices.' => 'Nyetel ukuran font ing njero kolom formulir dadi 16px ing kaca sing dioptimalake dening plugin iki supaya ora otomatis nggedhekake nalika sesambungan karo kolom formulir ing piranti cilik.','Safari and other browsers might automatically zoom in on mobile devices to make the text easier to read when the font size is smaller than 16px.' => 'Safari lan browser liyane bisa uga kanthi otomatis nggedhekake tampilan ing piranti seluler supaya teks luwih gampang diwaca nalika ukuran font luwih cilik tinimbang 16px.','Enable script processing tracking on the browser console.' => 'Aktifake pelacakan pamrosesan skrip ing konsol browser.','Unminified assets' => 'Aset sing ora dikurangi','Google Maps scripts' => 'Skrip Google Maps','Do not remove duplicate Google Maps scripts' => 'Aja mbusak skrip Google Maps sing duplikat','When enabled, duplicate Google Maps scripts will NOT be removed which can cause errors and performance issues. Only use this option while troubleshooting.' => 'Nalika diaktifake, skrip Google Maps duplikat ORA bakal dibusak sing bisa nyebabake kesalahan lan masalah kinerja. Gunakake opsi iki mung nalika ngatasi masalah.','Widget areas' => 'Area widget','Last step on mobile' => 'Langkah pungkasan ing seluler','Display widgets only at last step on mobile' => 'Tampilake widget mung ing langkah pungkasan ing seluler','Display checkout trust badge widgets only when viewing the last checkout step on mobile devices' => 'Tampilake widget lencana kepercayaan checkout mung nalika ndeleng langkah checkout pungkasan ing piranti seluler','Standard' => 'Standar','VAT number field' => 'Kolom nomer PPN','Add a VAT number field to the billing form.' => 'Tambahna kolom nomer PPN menyang formulir tagihan.','Field label' => 'Label lapangan','Set the label of the VAT number field (ie. VAT number). On multi-language websites, it is better to leave this field empty and translate the original string.' => 'Setel label kolom nomer PPN (kayata nomer PPN). Ing situs web multi-basa, luwih becik kolom iki dikosongake lan nerjemahake string asline.','VAT Number' => 'Nomer PPN','EU-VAT' => 'PPN EU','Enable the VAT number field to see more options' => 'Aktifake kolom nomer PPN kanggo ndeleng opsi liyane','VAT validation' => 'Validasi PPN','Validate VAT number field for EU-VAT during checkout' => 'Validasi kolom nomer PPN kanggo EU-VAT nalika checkout','Checks if the VAT Number provided is a valid VAT number registered on the European VIES Database (VAT Information Exchange System).' => 'Ngecek apa Nomer PPN sing diwenehake minangka nomer PPN sing valid sing kadhaptar ing Database VIES Eropa (Sistem Pertukaran Informasi PPN).','Shop VAT number' => 'Nomer PPN toko','The shop\'s VAT number used for requesting EU-VAT validation, and printed on invoices. <br><strong>We strongly recommend adding your Shop VAT number</strong> as otherwise the VIES consultation results might not be valid for accounting purposes. <br>Ie.: <code>ATU99999999</code> or <code>EE999999999</code>.' => 'Nomer PPN toko digunakake kanggo njaluk validasi EU-PPN, lan dicithak ing faktur.<br> <strong>Disaranake banget kanggo nambahake nomer PPN Toko sampeyan</strong> amarga yen ora, asil konsultasi VIES bisa uga ora valid kanggo tujuan akuntansi.<br> IE.: <code>ATU99999999</code> utawa <code>EE999999999</code> .','Reverse charge' => 'Pangisian daya mundur','Apply reverse charge mechanism' => 'Terapna mekanisme pangisian daya balik','Set tax rate to zero and display "Reverse charge" on invoices when the customer\'s VAT number is valid. A different "Reverse charge" text might be required depending on the store\'s country.' => 'Setel tarif pajak dadi nol lan tampilake &quot;Biaya balik&quot; ing faktur nalika nomer PPN pelanggan valid. Teks &quot;Biaya balik&quot; sing beda bisa uga dibutuhake gumantung saka negara toko kasebut.','Same country' => 'Negara sing padha','Apply reverse charge mechanism for transactions in the shop country:' => 'Terapna mekanisme biaya balik kanggo transaksi ing negara toko:','Enables applying reverse charge mechanism for transactions between companies in the same country as the shop.' => 'Ngidini ngetrapake mekanisme biaya terbalik kanggo transaksi antarane perusahaan ing negara sing padha karo toko.','Reverse charge exceptions' => 'Pengecualian biaya balik','Select additional countries to skip applying the reverse charge mechanism.' => 'Pilih negara tambahan kanggo nglewati penerapan mekanisme pangisian daya terbalik.','Taxes will be charged to orders from these countries even when a valid VAT number is provided.' => 'Pajak bakal dikenani biaya kanggo pesenan saka negara-negara kasebut sanajan nomer PPN sing valid diwenehake.','Reverse charge label on invoices' => 'Label tagihan balik ing faktur','Set the label of "reverse charge" on the checkout page and order details.' => 'Setel label &quot;biaya mundur&quot; ing kaca checkout lan rincian pesenan.','Reverse charge text on invoices' => 'Teks tagihan balik ing faktur','Set the label of "reverse charge" text on invoices.' => 'Setel label teks &quot;biaya balik&quot; ing faktur.','Tax to be paid on reverse charge basis' => 'Pajak sing kudu dibayar kanthi basis biaya terbalik','Company name' => 'Jeneng perusahaan','Autocomplete company name from VAT number' => 'Jeneng perusahaan sing diisi otomatis saka nomer PPN','Fill in the billing company name based on the valid VAT number provided by the customer.' => 'Isi jeneng perusahaan tagihan adhedhasar nomer PPN sing sah sing diwenehake dening pelanggan.','Company name editing' => 'Suntingan jeneng perusahaan','Allow editing of auto-filled company name' => 'Ngidini nyunting jeneng perusahaan sing diisi otomatis','When enabled, customers can change the company name associated with the provided VAT number.' => 'Nalika diaktifake, pelanggan bisa ngganti jeneng perusahaan sing ana gandhengane karo nomer PPN sing diwenehake.','EU-VAT for digital goods' => 'EU-VAT kanggo barang digital','From January 1st, 2015, modifications have been made to the EU VAT regulations concerning digital goods, impacting exclusively B2C transactions. The VAT on digital goods must be calculated based on the customer\'s location, and evidence of this needs to be collected (IP address and billing address).' => 'Wiwit tanggal 1 Januari 2015, modifikasi wis ditindakake ing peraturan PPN EU babagan barang digital, sing mung mengaruhi transaksi B2C. PPN kanggo barang digital kudu diitung adhedhasar lokasi pelanggan, lan bukti iki kudu dikumpulake (alamat IP lan alamat tagihan).','Tax classes for digital goods' => 'Kelas pajak kanggo barang digital','Select some tax classes' => 'Pilih sawetara kelas pajak','Location evidence' => 'Bukti lokasi','Collect customer\'s location evidence' => 'Ngumpulake bukti lokasi pelanggan','Saves the IP address and validate it against the customer\'s billing address. Customer\'s must confirm their billing address by checking a checkbox on the checkout page if the country from their billing address and IP do not match.' => 'Nyimpen alamat IP lan validasi karo alamat tagihan pelanggan. Pelanggan kudu ngonfirmasi alamat tagihan kanthi mriksa kothak centhang ing kaca checkout yen negara saka alamat tagihan lan IP ora cocog.','This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. <a href="%s">Change it in Customer accounts settings</a>.' => 'Opsi iki dikelola ing Fluid Checkout. <a href="%s">Owahi ing setelan akun Pelanggan</a> .','This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. Change it under Fluid Checkout > Customer accounts.' => 'Opsi iki dikelola ing Fluid Checkout. Owahi ing Fluid Checkout &gt; Akun pelanggan.','This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. The shipping destination is always set to "Default to customer shipping address" when Fluid Checkout is activated. Customers can still provide different shipping and billing addresses during checkout.<br><br>An option for setting the default billing address to be the same as the shipping address is available in the <a href="%s">Fluid Checkout settings</a>.' => 'Opsi iki dikelola ing Fluid Checkout. Tujuan pengiriman mesthi disetel dadi &quot;Default to customer shipping address&quot; nalika Fluid Checkout diaktifake. Pelanggan isih bisa menehi alamat pengiriman lan tagihan sing beda-beda sajrone checkout.<br><br> Pilihan kanggo nyetel alamat tagihan gawan supaya padha karo alamat pengiriman kasedhiya ing <a href="%s">setelan Fluid Checkout</a> .','This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. The shipping destination is always set to "Default to customer shipping address" when Fluid Checkout is activated. Customers can still provide different shipping and billing addresses during checkout.<br><br>An option for setting the default billing address to be the same as the shipping address is available at WooCommerce > Settings > Fluid Checkout.' => 'Opsi iki dikelola ing Fluid Checkout. Tujuan pengiriman mesthi disetel dadi &quot;Default to customer shipping address&quot; nalika Fluid Checkout diaktifake. Pelanggan isih bisa menehi alamat pengiriman lan tagihan sing beda-beda sajrone checkout.<br><br> Pilihan kanggo nyetel alamat tagihan standar supaya padha karo alamat pengiriman kasedhiya ing WooCommerce &gt; Setelan &gt; Pembayaran Cairan.','These settings have been moved to WP Admin > Fluid Checkout > Settings.' => 'Setelan iki wis dipindhah menyang WP Admin &gt; Fluid Checkout &gt; Setelan.','This WooCommerce Settings tab is deprecated and will be removed in Fluid Checkout 6.0.' => 'Tab Setelan WooCommerce iki wis ora digunakake maneh lan bakal dibusak ing Fluid Checkout 6.0.','Go to settings page' => 'Bukak kaca setelan','Hide this tab permanently' => 'Ndhelikake tab iki permanen','Site report preview' => 'Pratinjau laporan situs','This is the data that would be included in the next site environment report based on your current settings.' => 'Iki data sing bakal dilebokake ing laporan lingkungan situs sabanjure adhedhasar setelan sampeyan saiki.','Loading report preview...' => 'Ngunggah pratinjau laporan...','Could not load the site report preview. Try again.' => 'Ora bisa mbukak pratinjau laporan situs. Coba maneh.','Could not send the site report. Try again.' => 'Ora bisa ngirim laporan situs. Coba maneh.','Site report sent successfully.' => 'Laporan situs wis kasil dikirim.','Enable and send now' => 'Aktifake lan kirim saiki','Close' => 'Tutup','A site report request is already in progress. Try again in a moment.' => 'Panjaluk laporan situs wis lagi diproses. Coba maneh sakcepete.','Site environment reporting is disabled.' => 'Pelaporan lingkungan situs dipateni.','No site report data is available to send.' => 'Ora ana data laporan situs sing kasedhiya kanggo dikirim.','This site domain cannot send environment reports (local or development domains are excluded).' => 'Domain situs iki ora bisa ngirim laporan lingkungan (domain lokal utawa pangembangan ora kalebu).','A site report was sent recently. Try again later.' => 'Laporan situs wis dikirim bubar iki. Coba maneh mengko.','The site report could not be sent. Try again later.' => 'Laporan situs ora bisa dikirim. Coba maneh mengko.','Site environment reporting is not available.' => 'Pelaporan lingkungan situs ora kasedhiya.','No site report data is available for the selected settings.' => 'Ora ana data laporan situs sing kasedhiya kanggo setelan sing dipilih.','You are not allowed to manage site reports.' => 'Sampeyan ora diidini ngatur laporan situs.','PRO feature' => 'Fitur PRO','Other plugins' => 'Plugin liyane','Get only this add-on &mdash; %s' => 'Entuk mung add-on iki — %s','Install add-on' => 'Instal tambahan','Upgrade to PRO &mdash; %s' => 'Nganyarke menyang PRO — %s','<a target="_blank" href="%1$s">Get %2$s</a> to unlock these options.' => '<a target="_blank" href="%1$s">Entuk %2$s</a> kanggo mbukak kunci opsi iki.','Add-on' => 'Tambahan','View documentation' => 'Deleng dokumentasi','Requests require a logged-in WordPress user. Omit user_id to use the current user\'s data, or pass user_id to target another account when the caller can edit that user (edit_user capability). Unauthenticated requests return fc_api_forbidden. An invalid user_id returns fc_api_user_not_found.' => 'Panjaluk mbutuhake panganggo WordPress sing wis mlebu log. Ora perlu nganggo user_id kanggo nggunakake data panganggo saiki, utawa lebokna user_id kanggo nargetake akun liyane nalika sing nelpon bisa nyunting panganggo kasebut (kemampuan edit_user). Panjaluk sing ora diautentikasi bakal ngasilake fc_api_forbidden. User_id sing ora valid bakal ngasilake fc_api_user_not_found.','HTTP 200 with { "data": { ... } } when the handler returns a payload.' => 'HTTP 200 nganggo { &quot;data&quot;: { ... } } nalika pawang ngasilake payload.','HTTP 200 with { "success": true } when there is no payload (for example DELETE).' => 'HTTP 200 nganggo {&quot;success&quot;: true} nalika ora ana payload (contone DELETE).','Failures return WordPress REST error JSON from WP_Error (code, message, data.status). Wire codes use the fc_api_* prefix.' => 'Gagal bakal ngasilake kesalahan REST WordPress JSON saka WP_Error (kode, pesen, data.status). Kode kabel nggunakake awalan fc_api_*.','Forbidden access.' => 'Akses sing dilarang.','Target user was not found.' => 'Panganggo target ora ditemokake.','This feature is not available.' => 'Fitur iki ora kasedhiya.','A required address field is missing.' => 'Kolom alamat sing dibutuhake ilang.','Postcode or ZIP is invalid.' => 'Kode pos utawa Kode Pos ora valid.','Phone number is invalid.' => 'Nomer telpon ora valid.','State or county is invalid.' => 'Negara utawa kabupaten ora sah.','Country is invalid or has no address fields.' => 'Negara ora valid utawa ora ana kolom alamat.','The request could not be processed.' => 'Panjaluk kasebut ora bisa diproses.','Back to previous step' => 'Bali menyang langkah sadurunge','Skip to settings' => 'Langsung menyang setelan','Start over and return to the first guided setup step' => 'Miwiti maneh saka wiwitan lan bali menyang langkah persiyapan sing dipandu pisanan','Start over' => 'Miwiti maneh','Please complete all sub-steps before continuing.' => 'Mangga rampungake kabeh sub-langkah sadurunge nerusake.','Expand' => 'Ngembangake','Collapse' => 'Ciut','Skip' => 'Lompati','Mark as complete' => 'Tandhani minangka rampung','Mark as incomplete' => 'Tandhani minangka durung rampung','View full-size image: %s' => 'Deleng gambar ukuran lengkap: %s','Full-size setup guide image' => 'Gambar pandhuan persiyapan ukuran lengkap','Close image' => 'Tutup gambar','Fluid Checkout Guided Setup' => 'Persiapan sing Dipandu dening Pamriksan Cairan','Welcome' => 'Sugeng rawuh','Explore your checkout' => 'Jelajahi kasir sampeyan','All set' => 'Kabeh wis siyap','You do not have permission to access this page.' => 'Sampeyan ora duwe idin kanggo ngakses kaca iki.','Go to step %1$d: %2$s' => 'Pindhah menyang langkah %1$d: %2$s','This guided setup helps you get familiar with Fluid Checkout. The steps below are placeholders for now.' => 'Pandhuan persiyapan iki mbantu sampeyan luwih kenal karo Fluid Checkout. Langkah-langkah ing ngisor iki mung minangka papan dununge kanggo saiki.','Continue to the next step when you are ready.' => 'Terusake menyang langkah sabanjure nalika sampeyan wis siyap.','Open your store checkout to see Fluid Checkout in action.' => 'Bukak kasir toko sampeyan kanggo ndeleng Fluid Checkout lagi aktif.','View checkout page' => 'Deleng kaca pambayaran','You can return to Fluid Checkout settings to continue configuring your store.' => 'Sampeyan bisa bali menyang setelan Fluid Checkout kanggo nerusake konfigurasi toko sampeyan.','Review checkout and cart settings' => 'Priksa setelan checkout lan kranjang','Explore add-ons from the dashboard' => 'Jelajahi add-on saka dashboard','Finish & go to settings' => 'Rampung &amp; pindhah menyang setelan','Update the billing phone field visibility option from the legacy value to match WooCommerce conventions.' => 'Nganyari opsi visibilitas kolom telpon tagihan saka nilai lawas supaya cocog karo konvensi WooCommerce.','Update the shipping phone field visibility option from the legacy value to match WooCommerce conventions.' => 'Nganyari opsi visibilitas kolom telpon pengiriman saka nilai lawas supaya cocog karo konvensi WooCommerce.','Copy the order summary background color setting to the new Split design secondary column background color option.' => 'Salin setelan warna latar mburi ringkesan pesenan menyang pilihan warna latar mburi kolom sekunder desain Split sing anyar.','The enhanced select fields feature is always disabled when using the Biteship plugin.' => 'Fitur kolom pilihan sing ditingkatake mesthi dipateni nalika nggunakake plugin Biteship.','The place order position is always set to "Below the order summary" when using German Market. That plugin requires the place order button and legal checkboxes to be displayed below the order summary.' => 'Posisi pesenan tansah disetel menyang &quot;Ing ngisor ringkesan pesenan&quot; nalika nggunakake Pasar Jerman. Plugin kasebut mbutuhake tombol pesenan lan kothak centhang legal supaya ditampilake ing ngisor ringkesan pesenan.','The place order position is always set to "Below the order summary" when using Germanized for WooCommerce. That plugin requires the place order button and legal checkboxes to be displayed below the order summary.' => 'Posisi pesenan tansah disetel menyang &quot;Ing ngisor ringkesan pesenan&quot; nalika nggunakake Germanized kanggo WooCommerce. Plugin kasebut mbutuhake tombol pesenan lan kothak centhang legal supaya ditampilake ing ngisor ringkesan pesenan.','Edit pickup locations' => 'Sunting lokasi pengambilan','Use local pickup label from WooCommerce settings' => 'Gunakake label pickup lokal saka setelan WooCommerce','When enabled, the pickup option label on checkout matches the title from WooCommerce pickup location settings. When disabled, the label uses the translatable "Local pickup" text from Fluid Checkout.' => 'Nalika diaktifake, label opsi pengambilan nalika checkout cocog karo judhul saka setelan lokasi pengambilan WooCommerce. Nalika dipateni, label kasebut nggunakake teks &quot;Pengambilan lokal&quot; sing bisa diterjemahake saka Fluid Checkout.','Button label for applying coupon codesApply' => 'nglamar','Checkout step titleContact' => 'Kontak','Checkout step titleShipping' => 'Pengiriman','Checkout step titleBilling' => 'Tagihan','Checkout step titlePayment' => 'pambayaran','Checkout substep change link labelChange' => 'Ganti','Checkout substep save link labelSave changes' => 'Simpen owah-owahan','Substep review textNone.' => 'ora ana.','Substep review field format%1$s' => '%1$s','Substep review field format: with label%2$s: %1$s' => '%2$s: %1$s','Image uploader.No image selected.' => 'Ora ana gambar sing dipilih.','Settings sectionCart' => 'grobag','Settings sectionOrder pay' => 'Pembayaran pesenan','Settings sectionThank you' => 'matur nuwun','Settings section titleIntegrations' => 'Integrasi','Settings section titleLicense keys' => 'Tombol lisensi','Captcha positionBefore place order section' => 'Sadurunge bagean pesenan panggonan','Captcha positionBefore place order button' => 'Tombol sadurunge pesenan','No shipping method chosen label for the order summary--' => '--','Close button aria-labelClose' => 'Nutup','Log in link label at checkout contact stepLog in' => 'mlebu log','Log in separator label at for when guest checkout is disabledOr continue below' => 'Utawa terus ing ngisor iki','Log in separator label at for when guest checkout is disabledOr continue as a guest' => 'Utawa terus dadi tamu','Clear image selection on admin pages.Remove image' => 'Mbusak gambar','shipping packagesShipping %d' => 'Pangiriman %d','shipping packagesShipping' => 'Pangiriman','Used as fallback for "Proceed to next step" button labelnext step' => 'langkah sabanjure','Substep review checkbox valueYes' => 'Ya','Substep review checkbox line%1$s: %2$s' => '%1$s: %2$s','Dummy customer first name in the admin previewJohn' => 'Yohanes','Dummy customer last name in the admin previewDoe' => 'Doe','Dummy customer company in the admin previewExample Company' => 'Perusahaan Tuladha','Dummy customer street address in the admin preview123 Main Street' => '123 Dalan Utama','Dummy customer city in the admin previewAnytown' => 'Kutha endi wae','Dummy order notes in the admin previewPlease leave the package at the front door.' => 'Tulung tinggalna paket iki ing ngarep lawang.','Dummy product name in the admin previewBeanie' => 'Beanie','Dummy product name in the admin previewCap' => 'Topi','Dummy product name in the admin previewT-Shirt' => 'Kaos','Dummy order update in the admin previewWe received your order and will send you an update when it ships.' => 'Pesenan panjenengan sampun dipuntampi lan badhé dipunberi kabar nalika sampun dipunkirim.','Dummy download in the admin previewUser guide' => 'Pandhuan panganggo','Google Places API versionsPlaces API (New)' => 'API Panggonan (Anyar)','Google Places API versionsPlaces API (Legacy)' => 'API Panggonan (Warisan)','Brasil API versionsVersion 1' => 'Versi 1','Brasil API versionsVersion 2' => 'Versi 2','Delayed account creation benefits placeholder text✔ Checkout faster next time
